这是很有学问的啊...… 然后问了一下项目就结束了，虽然我跟他两个人说说笑笑的，但是我当时就觉得他们想找背景完全符合的[牛泪]...被刷了但是分享一下内容攒人品 #面经(148)","newContent":{"data":[{"text":"# 周六面试，男面试官 自我介绍，为什么选这个岗， 问对大疆产品的认识， 然后就开始和技术岗一样问你对于项目管理的知识了解哪些， 我就有点傻眼因为我是理工科背景...，只学过企业组织与管理，经济与管理，六西格玛精益管理等管理科目 唯独没有项目管理…我把这些说了一遍，并且说我有管理学的基础，可以很快学习新的， 但是他好像不是很care，就是一直在说要学过才行啊，这是很有学问的啊...… 然后问了一下项目就结束了，虽然我跟他两个人说说笑笑的，但是我当时就觉得他们想找背景完全符合的[牛泪]...被刷了但是分享一下内容攒人品 #面经(148)","color":null,"router":null}]},"type":0,"status":0,"hasEdit":false,"isAnonymousFlag":false,"beMyOnly":false,"linkMoment":null,"imgMoment":null,"clockMoment":null,"videoMoment":null,"createdAt":1663814861000,"circle":null,"editTime":1663814861000,"edited":false,"showTime":1663814861000},"subjectData":[],"voteData":{"voteId":0,"withVote":false,"voteTitle":null,"voteType":null},"blogZhuanlan":null,"frequencyData":{"likeCnt":4,"followCnt":8,"commentCnt":1,"totalCommentCnt":2,"viewCnt":993,"shareCnt":0,"isLike":false,"isFollow":false,"flowerData":null},"extraInfo":{"contentType_var":"MOMENTS","trackID_var":"2gpdpwa3fo4phkcv6rr9v","contentID_var":"1478173","trackId":"2gpdpwa3fo4phkcv6rr9v","dolphin_var":";","entityId":"740001478173","searchTaxonomyEnum":null,"entityID_var":"740001478173"},"internalRecommend":null}},{"rc_type":207,"entityDataId":478988,"triggerId":null,"trackId":"2gpdpwa3fo4phkcv6rr9v","title":null,"expandType":0,"extraInfo":{"contentType_var":"POST","trackID_var":"2gpdpwa3fo4phkcv6rr9v","contentID_var":"478988","trackId":"2gpdpwa3fo4phkcv6rr9v","dolphin_var":";","entityId":"80000478988","searchTaxonomyEnum":null,"entityID_var":"80000478988"},"data":{"contentId":"353156767901229056","contentType":250,"interviewExp":null,"userBrief":{"userId":230986038,"nickname":"GaaraNi","admin":false,"followed":false,"headImgUrl":"https://uploadfiles.nowcoder.com/images/20200806/230986038_1596677976518_B8F04BC69A410E65DDF423E251947CAF","gender":"男","headDecorateUrl":"","honorLevel":5,"honorLevelName":"青出于蓝 Lv.4","honorLevelColor":"42c1a2","workTime":"2020","educationInfo":"Northern Ari